  "evidencia": "Page: Courtney Love. Sentence: Courtney Michelle Love (born Courtney Michelle Harrison; July 9, 1964) is an American singer, songwriter, actress, and visual artist.\nPage: Courtney Love. Sentence: She rose to prominence as the frontwoman of the alternative rock band Hole, which she formed in 1989.\nPage: The Wolfhounds. Sentence: The Wolfhounds are an indie pop/noise pop band formed in Romford, UK in 1985 by Dave Callahan, Paul Clark, Andy Golding, Andy Bolton and Frank Stebbing, and originally active until 1990.\nPage: Feeling Minnesota. Sentence: Feeling Minnesota is a 1996 American crime drama comedy film, written and directed by Steven Baigelman, starring Keanu Reeves, Vincent D'Onofrio, Cameron Diaz, Tuesday Weld, Dan Aykroyd, Delroy Lindo and Courtney Love.",
